bizarre threats

00:01:54.681 --> 00:01:56.482
about what he'll do if he loses.

00:01:56.482 --> 00:01:59.018
-If I lose to him,
I don't know what I'm gonna do.

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:00.619
I will never speak to you again.

00:02:00.619 --> 00:02:03.689
Can you imagine if I lose, my
whole life, what am I gonna do?

00:02:03.689 --> 00:02:06.292
I'm gonna say,
"I lost to the worst candidate

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:08.561
