00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:10.663
I'm not going to feel so good.

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:12.131
Maybe I'll have to
leave the country?

00:02:12.131 --> 00:02:14.800
I don't know.
-Oh, I don't know if you heard.

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:17.470
